maintainers         {kokybiskasvetaine.lt:info @ello-lithuania} openmaintainer

description         Validate Lithuanian personal codes, company codes, VAT numbers and IBANs
long_description    ${name} is a small command line tool that checks Lithuanian \
                    personal codes (asmens kodas), company codes (juridinio asmens \
                    kodas), VAT numbers (PVM moketojo kodas) and IBANs. Each code is \
                    printed with what it is valid as, and the exit status is 0 when \
                    every code is valid.

